{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_04",
  "title": "我曾捨命為你",
  "storyCode": "HE-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c28c7222bfd4f88185f8665506af4df85a06aa1ca9ef262c4b6efc77fb77dd28",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火焰是會吞噬一切的魔鬼。\n再珍貴的物品，再受珍視的東西，只要一把火，一切都會就此消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "杰拉爾德曾和我說，他們薩卡茲沒有故鄉，只有如影隨形的戰火。但他希望他們能有一個故鄉，因此他們願意跟隨一位了不起的大人物。\n只是後來他失望了，所以選擇離開。\n那時我不敢問他為什麼失望。\n剛來到這裡時，我們曾經滿懷希望。\n這些年生活雖然辛苦，大家卻仍感到幸福。\n但是現在......現在。\n現在他們要離開了。我忍不住會想，是不是因為這裡的生活也同樣已經令他失望？\n我呢？我又如何？\n現在我正......我正看著那些我珍視的東西，在我眼前燃燒。\n燃燒。\n消失殆盡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "全都......沒了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "好燙......！好大的火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "燒起來了！聖堂......聖堂燒起來了！快！快打水來救火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "怎麼回事？我看到有火光，發生什麼事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "萊蒙德！你怎麼在這？你們不是，不是已經......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "......現在不是說這個的時候！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "呃！對，對，你說得沒錯......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "你來得正好！聖堂著火了，快來幫忙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "聖堂？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "聖堂怎麼會......怎麼會忽然著火？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "我也想知道啊！往年這個季節也不是沒有過火災，但沒一次燒得這麼厲害，怎麼偏偏就在這時候出岔子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "唉，總之得先把火滅了！幸好燒起來的不是大夥住的地方......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "先救火。等著，我去喊人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "水呢！咳......咳咳，還有沒有水，再打點水來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "不行，這火勢壓不住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "你小心點，別吸這煙......我們得把大門關上，或許這樣火就不會燒到外頭來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "不行！你說什麼混帳話！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "這可是聖堂！聖像還在裡頭！門關上，咳，門關上難道火就能熄了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "我不是這個意思！但現在太危險了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "正確的判斷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "啊？你懂什麼......你是什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "這兩個孩子是......不對，你、你怎麼能讓孩子留在這麼危險的地方？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "快離遠點！這裡不安全！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "你說得對，這裡並不安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "你已經吸入不少煙塵，如不立即採取相應防護措施，推測將很快出現頭暈、重影等生理反應。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "那又怎麼樣？說了這麼多，有沒有點實際的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "我之前沒見過你，你、你是薩科塔，你是拉特蘭來的人吧！想點辦法啊，那可是拉特蘭的聖像！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "聖像並非我的任務中需要顧及的目標對象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "你在說什麼......什麼任務不任務的！現在是說這些的時候嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "你就不能用個什麼，那種什麼法術，把這該死的火給滅了？你要是根本什麼都幹不了，就站到一邊去，別礙著我救火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "......抱歉，我無法使用那樣的源石技藝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "想要儘量減少損失，需要更多人參與滅火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "我這就去喊人來幫忙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "有人來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "你們......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "來幫忙。萊蒙德通知了我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "少說廢話，快點接一下水桶！我再去搬兩桶來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "啊，好，好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "這裡還有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "我來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "你們去安全的地方等待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "你是那個拉特蘭的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "這兩個小孩怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "我不建議現在花時間討論這個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "桶給你，抬穩了，小子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "克萊芒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "喂，別再往前走了，站住......克萊芒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "我不建議你現在進入火場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "放開、放開我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "在沒有採取充足的防護措施的情況下，這樣做會非常危險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "這個小哥說得對！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "你這是幹什麼？你不要命了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "我得去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "我得......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......抱歉，我剛剛有點頭暈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "......我知道出了這事最不好受的就是你，但你別發昏，這可不是鬧著玩的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "你的那些花......花總能再種。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "水桶又要空了，我再去打點水來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "不能再往裡走了！火太大，還有煙......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "你可以留下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "為避免煙霧中毒，建議你不要大聲說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "我說話是為了誰？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "你不用跟著我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "......我信不過你，我得盯著你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "不對，你聽到什麼聲音沒有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火焰熊熊燃燒，持銃的聖像發出不祥的嗡鳴。\n帶著灼熱溫度的陰影投在萊蒙德身上，像是要審判這個竟敢走入薩科塔聖堂的薩卡茲，巨大的聖像在火海中傾倒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "後退！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刺耳的碎裂聲在耳畔響起。預想中的疼痛並未造訪。\n執行者擋在薩卡茲身前，緊握著銃的手臂抬起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "還有二次倒塌的風險，從這邊走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "你的手臂......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "不，等等，你打碎了聖像？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "沒有碎。如果不改變其倒下的方向，你會被砸中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "可這是你們的聖像......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "不重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "火勢還在增大，這很奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "木製的長椅等內部陳設雖然易燃，但最初起火的位置有古怪，不能排除內部還有其他助燃物的可能性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "什麼意思？你到底想說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "這是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（這裡就是薩卡茲住的地方？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（......就靠這麼薄的牆板，根本抵禦不了荒原上的寒風。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（呼......真的有點冷呢。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（耽擱得太久，天都已經黑了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（嗯？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（那邊樓頂的是......火光？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（這種時候著火......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（看來費德里科那邊也出了不小的問題哦。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（......！有人來了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "他們都去修道院裡幫忙了，我們要不要也過去看看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "斯特凡諾對我們很好，就算我們已經要走了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "要去你去，我才不去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "不是還有今天來的拉特蘭人嗎？讓那些拉特蘭人救他們去吧！我們沒這個本事，就別去討人嫌了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（哎呀，習慣性地躲起來了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（聽起來像是鬧矛盾了？我和奧倫剛到這裡的時候，應該還不是這樣的氛圍......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "別太生氣了，蕾拉她......她也不是有意要那麼說的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "她不是故意的，那說明她心底裡就這麼想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "她懷疑我偷她的冬衣！我什麼時候幹過這種糟心事？往年這些都是由我負責，怎麼之前她就沒懷疑過？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "他們，唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "她就是覺得我們礙眼！他們都是那麼想的！他們從沒把我們當成一夥的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "斯特凡諾不同意撇下我們回拉特蘭，他們就恨上我們了！我算是看清楚了，只有我們自作多情，那些人從沒把我們當成一夥的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "杰拉爾德老大當初說要走，我還有點猶豫，現在看來就該這麼辦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "走就走，誰怕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "但是......我們真的能走出這片荒野嗎？探路的幾個小夥子到現在都沒回來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "那也比繼續待著強。我怕要是再有下回，我就忍不住要揍人了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "（......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "......真冷啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "把自己關在房間裡久了，都不知道外面的夜晚這麼冷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "真是重大失職，薇爾麗芙恐怕要扣我的工資了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "唔，要是真被扣了，下下個月就不給莫斯提馬買那個六層閃光水果蛋糕，自己做一個省省錢好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "沒時間再耽擱了呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "——找到你了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "終於滅了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "東西基本都燒沒了，不過還好，至少沒燒到下面的屋子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "還好？哪裡好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "聖像都燒成這樣了，還有花圃......呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "人沒事就是好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "喂，萊蒙德，你們那邊還好吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "還行。死不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "你小子命硬，還真敢就這麼往裡衝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "看杰拉爾德回頭知道了不揍你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "......別告訴杰拉爾德老大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "現在知道怕了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "出了這麼大的事，主教閣下怎麼還沒來，有人通知主教閣下了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "今天就先這樣吧，也沒其他辦法，先通知主教閣下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "大家都當心點，別再出這樣的意外......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "不是意外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾",
      "text": "大哥哥！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "text": "......你說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "這不是意外。初步推測有人蓄意縱火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "拉特蘭的小子，這話可不能亂說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "text": "不可能......誰會想燒聖堂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "喂，你這麼說有什麼根據？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "我說過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "火勢不正常，有其他助燃物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "......就這個？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "已經足夠得出結論。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "你這傢伙——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "等一下，萊蒙德。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "怎麼？你也想說是有人故意放火？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "我......不確定。但是之前......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "之前我去喊人，這地方平常來的人不多，特別是、特別是你們薩卡茲更不怎麼來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "但我卻在附近碰到了你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的薩卡茲居民",
      "text": "等會，你這話是什麼意思？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "費爾南，別打斷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "text": "讓他繼續說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "我、我沒別的意思。我就是想問問......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "text": "萊蒙德，你怎麼會恰好出現在這？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "......這就是你想讓我看的嗎，杰拉爾德？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "你我在場，大家都有所顧忌，聽不到多少真心話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "這就是我們的現狀，斯特凡諾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "我明白，我一直都明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "我不是怪誰。誰都沒錯。大夥只是想好好過日子，安安穩穩的，只是現狀如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "薩卡茲......註定漂泊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "......我說過，這裡會是你們的家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "你是說過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "你也曾說，你想試著讓那些孩子，在這裡扎下你們的根。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "或許是我錯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "你說的，誰都沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "......斯特凡諾，你最近心事重重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "你在計劃什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "text": "或者我該問，這場火......和你有關係嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
